{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UPDATED in 1.1: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics, small UI/UX featurettes, looking more slick and awsome. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ErfCity is a minimalist city-building puzzle game that challenges your strategic thinking and planning skills. Place buildings on a grid to gather points, but placement is key\u2014your score depends on how cleverly you position buildings near each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, you'll be offered a choice of 3 random buildings to place on the grid. Choose wisely as synergies between different building types tend to drastically change you score. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unique puzzle experience that's both relaxing and rewarding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, how efficiently can you build your city?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ErfCity</strong> offers two unique ways to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Challenge Mode</strong>, you, the player  must carefully plan their city within a set number of turns, maximizing points through synergies. Every decision counts. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode</strong> provides a more relaxed, experimental experience, allowing  for free building placement - without restrictions. This mode is perfect for testing strategies, exploring different layouts, and simply enjoying the creative process of city-building.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3491110?t=1764864937","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3491110?t=1764864937","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item